  "tagline": "A paste layer in, a stencil to cut out.",
  "description": "EH3D-STENCILCAM is a Rust library and command line that turn the pads of a paste layer, read with EH3D-CORE-LIBS, into the openings of a solder paste stencil and write them as G-code or HP-GL; built with the gui feature it also has a window (egui) that opens a paste layer, draws the pads and the cutting paths, edits the parameters and exports.",
